==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Cubone|57}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Cubone}}.
*{{m|Growl}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cubone}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

